      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003EYeomanry Pudding.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n93S. Take three ounces of fine sugar, three ounces of butter melted, three eggs well beaten, leaving out half the whites; mix all together, and put them into a dish lined with paste; put apricot or any other preserve at the bottom, and bake it.\u003Cbr\u003E"
